---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Use | Kvisl" description="Terms for using the Kvisl website.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Use</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Use</h1>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>You may read, quote, and share links to <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> essays. Quotations should preserve their context and identify the author, article title, and <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> as the source.</p>
      <p>Do not systematically scrape, mirror, or republish the site at scale, and do not impersonate <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>, its authors, or its editors.</p>
      <p><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> publishes for general reading and research discussion. Its content is not medical, legal, investment, or other professional advice.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
